1. Scope

This license covers every file in the BlackwellUI repository and in every
BlackwellUI release archive (source code, the generated data file
SpellIcons.lua and its generator output format, textures, images, layout,
names and documentation), except the third-party components listed in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which remain under their own licenses.


2. What you may do

You may, free of charge:

  a) download BlackwellUI from its official sources
     (https://github.com/Blackwellcode/BlackwellUI and its releases page);
  b) install and use it for your own, non-commercial play of the game
     Azeroth Survivors;
  c) read the source code and change your own local settings and
     saved variables;
  d) keep private backup copies for your own use;
  e) show BlackwellUI in screenshots, videos and streams.


3. What you may not do without prior written permission

Without the copyright holder's prior written permission you may not:

  a) redistribute BlackwellUI or any part of it, including re-uploads,
     mirrors, addon packs, launchers or bundles;
  b) publish, distribute or share modified versions or derivative works;
  c) copy code, data, textures or other assets into another project;
  d) sell, rent or otherwise commercially exploit BlackwellUI;
  e) remove or alter this notice, the copyright lines in the files or the
     author credit, or present BlackwellUI or parts of it as your own work;
  f) use the name "BlackwellUI" or its logo for another product.

Requests for permission: open an issue at
https://github.com/Blackwellcode/BlackwellUI/issues


